"Set up a device, or open Devices in Settings to restore a hidden device. Then check again." = "請設定裝置，或到設定的「裝置」頁還原隱藏的裝置，再重新檢查。";
"Beacon uses Bluetooth access to read accessory status. In System Settings, open Privacy & Security > Bluetooth and allow Beacon, then check again. A managed Mac may require administrator help." = "Beacon 需要藍牙存取權限才能讀取配件狀態。請在「系統設定」>「隱私權與安全性」>「藍牙」允許 Beacon，再重新檢查。受管理的 Mac 可能需要管理員協助。";
"A local device source did not respond. This does not mean there are no devices. Keep your devices awake and check again." = "本機裝置來源沒有回應，不代表沒有裝置。請讓裝置保持喚醒，再重新檢查。";
"Privacy & Security" = "隱私權與安全性";
"Check Again" = "重新檢查";
"Done" = "完成";
"Bluetooth access lets Beacon read accessory status. If access was denied, allow Beacon in System Settings > Privacy & Security > Bluetooth, then check again." = "藍牙存取權限讓 Beacon 讀取配件狀態。若曾拒絕權限，請到「系統設定」>「隱私權與安全性」>「藍牙」允許 Beacon，再重新檢查。";
"Install the iPhone tools first" = "請先安裝 iPhone 工具";
"Ready to check your iPhone" = "可以開始檢查 iPhone";
"No reachable iPhone detected" = "未偵測到可連接的 iPhone";
"Unlock your iPhone and review trust" = "請解鎖 iPhone 並確認信任";
