"New iPhone battery report received" = "已收到新的 iPhone 電量回報";
"iPhone and iPad Setup" = "iPhone 與 iPad 設定";
"Connect by USB, unlock the iPhone or iPad, and review Trust This Computer on the device. Previously trusted Wi-Fi devices may also be reachable. Beacon does not change your Wi-Fi sync settings." = "請以 USB 連接並解鎖 iPhone 或 iPad，再於裝置上確認「信任這部電腦」。先前已信任的 Wi-Fi 裝置也可能可連接；Beacon 不會變更 Wi-Fi 同步設定。";
"A device being added is not proof that a battery value was read. Only new reports from this check appear below." = "加入裝置不代表已讀到電量。下方只顯示這次檢查取得的新回報。";
"Check Access and Read Battery" = "檢查存取權並讀取電量";
